00:49:06,560 --> 00:49:09,120
这弯过得真是稀烂。
made a bit of a monkey's breakfast of that.

923
00:49:13,880 --> 00:49:16,160
于是我又试了一次。
So, I had another go.

924
00:49:19,040 --> 00:49:21,680
结果，老天啊。
And, oh dear.

925
00:49:21,720 --> 00:49:24,680
不仅搞得一塌糊涂，
我还当场破防了。
Made a monkey's breakfast
and then lost my temper.

926
00:49:29,120 --> 00:49:33,280
我在这条赛道上跑，
还从来没遇到过
I've never had such a problem
going round this track,

927
00:49:33,320 --> 00:49:35,600
开这车这么大的麻烦。
oh, as I'm having in this.

928
00:49:40,400 --> 00:49:42,880
所以，这玩意儿根本不算跑车。
This, then, is not a sports car.

929
00:49:42,920 --> 00:49:45,280
说实话，你随便换个台
Frankly, you're more likely
to find a sports car

930
00:49:45,320 --> 00:49:49,040
去看《格伦之王》或者《心跳》，
if you turn over and watch
Monarch Of The Glen or Heartbeat

931
00:49:49,080 --> 00:49:52,800
或者其他台播的随便什么年代剧，
都更有可能看到跑车。
or whatever period drama they've got
on the other side.

932
00:49:52,840 --> 00:49:56,120
连尼克·贝里的警盔——
都比这车更具运动感。
Nick Berry's helmet -
that's more sporty than this.

933
00:49:58,200 --> 00:50:01,720
不过，也许它压根就没打算
做一台驾驶者之车，
But then, perhaps, this isn't supposed
to be a driver's car,

934
00:50:01,760 --> 00:50:04,320
没想去和保时捷、法拉利硬碰硬。
a rival for Porsche and Ferrari.

935
00:50:04,360 --> 00:50:08,160
也许它只是想做一份
博洛尼亚肉酱面，
Perhaps it's supposed to be
a pasta and Bolognese alternative

936
00:50:08,200 --> 00:50:12,400
来代替捷豹那份
烤牛肉配约克郡布丁。
to the roast beef and Yorkshire pudding
that is Jaguar.

937
00:50:17,480 --> 00:50:20,320
如果是这样，那豪华感去哪儿了？
In which case, where's the opulence?

938
00:50:20,360 --> 00:50:24,840
他们凭什么装的是学校里的小窄凳，
而不是座椅？
Why have they fitted narrow little
school chairs instead of seats?

939
00:50:24,880 --> 00:50:29,320
捷豹XKR上那种安逸舒适的享受感
又去哪儿了？
Where's the sense of well-being that
you get from a Jag XKR?

940
00:50:29,360 --> 00:50:31,440
你知道这车是什么吗？
You know what this is?

941
00:50:31,480 --> 00:50:36,120
它就是一辆卖6.1万英镑的“差点意思先生”。
它被卡在了一片无人区里，
It's a £61,000 Mr. Nearly car.
It's stuck in a no-man's land

942
00:50:36,160 --> 00:50:40,200
夹在“捷豹顽石”
与“法拉利绝壁”的夹缝之间进退两难。
between the Jaguar Rock
and the Ferrari Hard Place.

943
00:50:41,720 --> 00:50:45,240
所以，这车彻底歇菜了？
- 呃，确实不行。
So, it's no good, then?
- No, not really.

944
00:50:45,280 --> 00:50:48,200
我的意思是，演播室观众的评价
基本就一句：
I mean, all I'm hearing from the studio
audience is, basically,

945
00:50:48,240 --> 00:50:49,680
“太烂了，一点都不好。”
"It's horrid, it's not very nice."

946
00:50:49,720 --> 00:50:51,520
事实也确实如此。因为你要是想要……
空间倒是挺大，这我得承认，
And it isn't really. 'Cause, if you want...

947
00:50:51,560 --> 00:50:53,280
但要是想买台舒服的巡航车，
it's got plenty of space, I will say that,

948
00:50:53,320 --> 00:50:56,680
直接买捷豹或者奔驰SL得了。
but if you want a comfortable
cruiser buy a Jag or Merc SL.

949
00:50:56,720 --> 00:51:00,680
如果想要极致性能，保时捷、
法拉利，你懂的。
If you want hardcore performance, Porsche,
Ferrari, you know.

950
00:51:00,720 --> 00:51:03,560
还不如买台DB7呢，对吧？
- 没错，那可强太多了。
You're better off buying a DB7, aren't you?
- Yeah. Much better off.

951
00:51:03,600 --> 00:51:06,640
不过它倒还有最后一次
挽回颜面的机会。
But it does have one chance
to redeem itself.

952
00:51:07,880 --> 00:51:10,160
唤醒斯提格！
Stoke up The Stig.

953
00:51:10,200 --> 00:51:13,400
他出发了！不过不管他跑完这圈用多久
都没意义了，
And he's off. But it doesn't matter
how long it takes him to get round,

954
00:51:13,440 --> 00:51:15,120
因为他光是发动车子
cause he's already wasted 15 minutes

955
00:51:15,160 --> 00:51:18,240
以及把变速箱和悬挂
getting it started and setting the gearbox
and the suspension

956
00:51:18,280 --> 00:51:22,600
调成斯提格专属的顺手状态，就浪费了15分钟——
当然，还有挑一张对胃口的CD！
to his Stiggy liking - that and choosing
the right CD, of course!

957
00:51:22,620 --> 00:51:25,620
（此处非原版背景音乐）
(This is not the original music)

958
00:51:30,200 --> 00:51:32,120
好了，他现在正逼近“锤头弯”。
Right, he's coming up to
the Hammerhead now.

959
00:51:32,160 --> 00:51:34,240
如果他过这个弯能不打转，
And if he can get around
here without spinning

960
00:51:34,280 --> 00:51:37,280
我们甚至可以恩准他圣诞节那天
进屋坐在壁炉旁烤火。
we might even let him come
and sit by the fire on Christmas Day.

961
00:51:41,760 --> 00:51:42,720
他搞定了！
He's done it!

962
00:51:47,760 --> 00:51:50,560
大脚给油，这玛莎拉蒂
在动力这块可绝不含糊。
Power now, and the Mas
is not lacking in that department.

963
00:51:50,600 --> 00:51:54,600
等杀过最后两个弯时，
速度已经快得吓人了。
Up to a huge speed by the time he
gets around the last two corners.

964
00:51:54,640 --> 00:51:56,880
逼近我们现在打算叫作“甘邦弯”的地方。
（节目中首次提及甘邦弯）
Up to what we'll now call Gambon Bend.
(First mention of Gambon in the show)

965
00:51:56,920 --> 00:52:00,440
他可没像迈克尔那样滑着横过去，
冲线了！
He's not gone sideways, like Michael,
and he's across the line.

966
00:52:01,920 --> 00:52:06,000
开得无可挑剔，
但成绩可不算多亮眼。
Brilliant driving but not
a particularly brilliant time.

967
00:52:06,040 --> 00:52:09,760
1分38秒。
观众：噢——
One minute 38 seconds.
AUDIENCE: Ooooh.

968
00:52:09,800 --> 00:52:13,080
这也就只比那辆宾利
快了那么一丁点儿。
That's only just slightly
faster than the Bentley.

969
00:52:13,120 --> 00:52:14,600
算不上一辆好车。
哈蒙德：确实不是。
Not a good car.
HAMMOND: No.

970
00:52:14,640 --> 00:52:17,000
好了，节目早些时候，
我们认识了那帮开白色厢货的哥们儿。
Right, earlier on,
we met our white-van men.

971
00:52:17,040 --> 00:52:19,040
他们一直在周围瞎转悠，自娱自乐，
They've been hanging around,
entertaining themselves,

972
00:52:19,080 --> 00:52:21,920
死磕《太阳报》上的填字游戏，顺便看美女。
struggling with the Sun crossword
and looking at girls.

973
00:52:21,960 --> 00:52:24,080
不过现在，他们又回来了，
But here they are again,

974
00:52:24,120 --> 00:52:26,200
而且个个都觉得自己车技了得、方向盘耍得飞起。
and they all reckon you know,
a bit handy on the road, behind the wheel.

975
00:52:26,240 --> 00:52:27,600
但真跑起来表现如何呢？
But how did they get on?

976
00:52:27,640 --> 00:52:29,080
尤其是在这么一个完全没机会……
Somewhere where there's no opportunity

977
00:52:29,120 --> 00:52:32,160
……把别人的后视镜给撞飞的地方？
to rip anyone's door mirrors off?

978
00:52:32,200 --> 00:52:34,920
按理说，他们本该开着各自的终极神车来迎战，
Naturally, they'd come in their
own weapons of choice

979
00:52:34,960 --> 00:52:37,160
但今天，他们开不成自己的车。
but, today, they wouldn't be using them.

980
00:52:37,200 --> 00:52:40,000
因为你要是想决出谁是开白厢货最快的男人，
Because if you're looking
for the fastest white-van man

981
00:52:40,040 --> 00:52:43,040
就得用一辆非比寻常的白色厢货。
you need a special kind of white van.

982
00:52:43,080 --> 00:52:44,840
福特WRC拉力版全顺，
The Ford World Rally Transit

983
00:52:44,880 --> 00:52:46,760
而且它可绝不只是拉花涂装唬人而已。
and it ain't just
a pretty paint job either.

984
00:52:46,800 --> 00:52:49,920
发动机经过改装，能爆发出200匹马力。
The engine's been modified to give 200 bhp.

985
00:52:49,960 --> 00:52:54,280
还配备了赛用规格的轮毂、刹车、悬挂和排气。
It's got race-spec wheels,
brakes, suspension and exhaust.

986
00:52:54,320 --> 00:52:56,720
而且，你瞧瞧这内饰！
And, just look at that.

987
00:52:56,760 --> 00:52:59,640
连里面都是如假包换的专业赛车货！
Even the interior is proper racing stuff!

988
00:53:10,320 --> 00:53:14,560
好，言归正传。
第一个上场的是约翰，来自皇家邮政。
Right, down to business.
And first up, John, from the Royal Mail.

989
00:53:14,600 --> 00:53:17,160
你到底是个大怂包，还是纯爷们厢货司机？
Are you a big wuss or a white-van man?

990
00:53:17,200 --> 00:53:19,480
三、二、一……
Three, two, one...

991
00:53:25,400 --> 00:53:27,400
皇家邮政的司机平时开车快吗？
Are Royal Mail drivers generally quick?

992
00:53:29,960 --> 00:53:33,120
快得很，路上到处别车加塞！
~ 没错，还真是。
They are. They cut you up everywhere!
- Yeah, yeah.

993
00:53:33,160 --> 00:53:35,400
而当“邮递员派特”在赛道上狂飙时，
And while Postman Pat was on the track,

994
00:53:35,440 --> 00:53:38,480
我也领教了几句白厢货司机的“人生真谛”。
I received a few nuggets
of white-van man wisdom.

995
00:53:38,520 --> 00:53:41,320
跟你说吧，全世界最差劲的就是她们了。女司机。
You know what, they're
the worst in the world. Women drivers.

996
00:53:41,360 --> 00:53:42,720
所有女司机？
All women drivers?

997
00:53:48,400 --> 00:53:52,480
下一位，来自冰岛的史蒂夫。
我是指那家超市，可不是那个国家。
Next, Steve from Iceland.
The firm, that is. Not the country.

998
00:53:55,040 --> 00:53:57,640
噢……哔——。
那个弯挡位挂错了。
Oh... [BLEEP].
Took that in the wrong gear.

999
00:54:00,600 --> 00:54:02,080
哇哦！
Whoa!

1000
00:54:02,120 --> 00:54:05,360
这位昨天可是刚刚干废了一辆警车。
This is the guy who yesterday
destroyed a police car.

1001
00:54:05,400 --> 00:54:07,800
真的假的？
- 真的，倒车撞上去的。
Did he?
- Yeah. Backed into it.

1002
00:54:09,000 --> 00:54:11,560
开着他那辆冰岛超市小货车直接撞报废了。
Wrote it off in his Iceland van.

1003
00:54:13,120 --> 00:54:16,600
[哀嚎]
[GROANING]

1004
00:54:16,640 --> 00:54:18,960
开小货车到底有没有什么诀窍？
Is there a technique to driving a van then?

1005
00:54:19,000 --> 00:54:21,200
有啊，油门踩到底。
- 油门踩死准没错。
Yeah. Put your foot down.
- Put your foot down is good.

1006
00:54:23,600 --> 00:54:25,800
求求你别给开烂了，史蒂夫。
Please don't break it, Steve.

1007
00:54:25,840 --> 00:54:28,720
车上撞出几个凹坑其实挺方便，
别人看到都会主动让路。
It's always handy to have dents in your
van cos more people get out the way.

1008
00:54:28,760 --> 00:54:31,600
而史蒂夫显然打定主意要再多添几个。
And Steve was determined to add a few more.

1009
00:54:42,680 --> 00:54:44,760
只是把固定支架给撞弯了。
Just bent the bracket holding it on.

1010
00:54:44,800 --> 00:54:48,080
下一位，唐。
他刚才过来的路上就迷路了。
Next up, Don. Who'd got
lost on the way down.

1011
00:54:48,120 --> 00:54:49,600
走那边！
It's that way.

1012
00:54:49,640 --> 00:54:50,480
然后左拐！
And then left.

1013
00:54:50,520 --> 00:54:54,680
三、二、一……跑！
Three, two, one... Go!

1014
00:54:56,240 --> 00:54:59,800
[笑声与掌声]
[LAUGHTER AND APPLAUSE]

1015
00:55:04,400 --> 00:55:06,080
果不其然……
And, sure enough...

1016
00:55:07,240 --> 00:55:08,480
他又迷路了。
he got lost again.

1017
00:55:08,520 --> 00:55:10,280
路人1：他又跑错方向了！
MAN 1: He's gone wrong again!

1018
00:55:11,080 --> 00:55:13,160
[笑声]
[LAUGHTER]

1019
00:55:13,200 --> 00:55:15,800
这边！
This way!

1020
00:55:15,840 --> 00:55:18,600
路人2：向左，向左，往左拐……啊！
MAN 2: Left, left. Go left... Ah!

1021
00:55:19,200 --> 00:55:20,800
[众人欢呼]
[ALL CHEERING]

1022
00:55:25,160 --> 00:55:27,440
他搞定了……你懂的。
He's done... you know.

1023
00:55:27,480 --> 00:55:30,600
他真是费尽心机，拼了老命了。
He worked for that. He worked hard.

1024
00:55:30,640 --> 00:55:32,640
戴尔是这帮人里最闷不作声的一个，
Dale was the quiet man of the bunch,

1025
00:55:32,680 --> 00:55:35,320
向来喜欢用驾驶技术说话。
happy to let his driving do the talking.

1026
00:55:40,840 --> 00:55:43,240
路人3：你倒是松离合啊！
MAN 3: You're supposed
to let the clutch out!

1027
00:55:45,360 --> 00:55:47,760
哈蒙德：终于来了个
地地道道的白货车狂人。
HAMMOND: At last,
a full-on white-van man.

1028
00:55:47,800 --> 00:55:50,720
人狠话不多，转速表踩爆。
Silent, but deadly with the rev-counter.

1029
00:55:55,480 --> 00:55:58,520
最后以周五下午5点29分
And to finish, the classic 5:29pm

1030
00:55:58,560 --> 00:56:01,280
经典的“急着回库下班”操作完美收官。
on a Friday return-to-base manoeuvre.

1031
00:56:06,720 --> 00:56:08,200
[众人欢呼]
[ALL CHEERING]

1032
00:56:09,400 --> 00:56:11,680
废掉了一个轮子。
He's done a wheel.

1033
00:56:11,720 --> 00:56:15,280
你这是在给我们货车司机抹黑！
You're giving us van drivers a bad name!

1034
00:56:15,320 --> 00:56:17,520
罗杰，可从来不是个缺自信的主儿，
Roger, not a man lacking in confidence,

1035
00:56:17,560 --> 00:56:18,920
那么你现在感觉如何？
so how are you feeling about this?

1036
00:56:18,960 --> 00:56:20,920
好得很，快让我开跑。
Very good. Get me going.

1037
00:56:20,960 --> 00:56:23,400
三、二、一……跑！
Three, two, one... Go!

1038
00:56:29,400 --> 00:56:31,560
又是一位老派的货车老炮儿。
And another vintage van man.

1039
00:56:31,600 --> 00:56:33,720
反正轮胎是别人的，压根不心疼……
Not fussed about someone else's tyres...

1040
00:56:37,080 --> 00:56:40,560
而且也完全不在乎地上的道路标线画在哪儿。
And not that fussed about where the
road markings go.

1041
00:56:44,440 --> 00:56:49,040
总的来说，罗杰那套“货车老司机”战术
帮他跑出了一圈不错的好成绩。
All in all, Roger's van man
tactics set him up for a nice, quick lap.

1042
00:56:49,080 --> 00:56:52,480
开得真不赖，是吧？挺顺的。
男士4：确实。
That was good, wasn't it? Smooth.
MAN 4: Yeah.

1043
00:56:54,080 --> 00:56:55,720
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

1044
00:57:00,600 --> 00:57:01,840
好！
Right!

1045
00:57:01,880 --> 00:57:03,160
好了！
Right!

1046
00:57:03,200 --> 00:57:05,480
成绩单就在我手里。
I have the results here.

1047
00:57:05,520 --> 00:57:08,680
至于第五名——我本来可是很看好你的。
And in fifth place - I was rooting for you.

1048
00:57:08,720 --> 00:57:12,040
结果你居然迷路了！
[笑声]
You got lost!
[LAUGHTER]

1049
00:57:12,080 --> 00:57:14,560
你简直废柴透顶！
You were useless!

1050
00:57:14,600 --> 00:57:19,440
大部分人基本上都是在
两分钟、两分十秒左右跑完的。
Most people did it in around about
two minutes, two minutes ten.

1051
00:57:19,480 --> 00:57:23,920
你居然足足用了四分五十五秒！
[笑声]
You took four minutes, 55!
[LAUGHTER]

1052
00:57:23,960 --> 00:57:26,280
所以鉴于此，
我们决定颁发给你
And as a result,
we would like to present you

1053
00:57:26,320 --> 00:57:28,080
一份“蠢蛋安慰奖”。
with a booby prize.

1054
00:57:28,120 --> 00:57:29,840
奖品就是当年
Which is part of the door mirror

1055
00:57:29,880 --> 00:57:35,600
迈克尔·甘本从铃木莉亚娜上
撞飞下来的半个后视镜！
that Michael Gambon knocked off
the Suzuki Liana!

1056
00:57:35,640 --> 00:57:37,680
唐，拿去吧。
- 谢谢你，杰里米。
Don, there you are.
- Thank you, Jeremy.

1057
00:57:37,720 --> 00:57:40,240
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

1058
00:57:40,280 --> 00:57:44,760
行，接下来看剩下的成绩。
第四名，用时两分零九秒，
Right, so the rest of the results.
In fourth place with two minutes and nine,

1059
00:57:44,800 --> 00:57:46,680
邮递员约翰。干得好，约翰。
John the postman. Well done, John.

1060
00:57:46,720 --> 00:57:48,760
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

1061
00:57:48,800 --> 00:57:52,760
第三名是水管工罗杰……
In third place, it's Roger the plumber...

1062
00:57:52,800 --> 00:57:55,080
是供暖工程师！
克拉克森：就是水管工！
Heating engineer!
CLARKSON: Plumber!

1063
00:57:55,120 --> 00:58:00,080
水管工！成绩是两分零五秒。
[掌声]
